{"from": "claim:ac-23-08-sadducees-no-resurrection", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-22-23-sadducees-no-resurrection", "note": "Matthew 22:23 reports the same Sadducean denial of the resurrection (in their question to Jesus); Acts 23:8 reports the doctrine in Paul's council speech. Same doctrine, different scenes."}
{"from": "claim:ac-23-05-quote-ruler", "type": "related_to", "to": "text:exodus-22-28", "note": "The law Paul quotes is Exodus 22:28 ('You shall not speak evil of a ruler of your people', WEB); biblical cross-reference within the same canon, not external evidence."}
{"from": "claim:ac-23-08-sadducees-no-angel-spirit", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:ac-23-08-pharisees-angels-spirit", "note": "Acts 23:8 states both halves of the same contrast (the Sadducees deny, the Pharisees confess, angel and spirit); kept as two claims because the external evidence grades differ (both none-found, with the same translation dispute noted)."}
